menu "LCD UI (lcd_ui) Configuration"

    config LCD_UI_MAX_WIDGETS
        int "Widgets per screen"
        range 4 64
        default 12
        help
            Size of the static widget pool. Every ui_screen_begin() empties it; a
            screen that adds more widgets fails in ui_screen_end() with
            ESP_ERR_NO_MEM. Footer lines count as widgets.

    config LCD_UI_TEXT_MAX
        int "Longest text per widget (characters)"
        range 16 512
        default 64
        help
            Every widget copies its text (ui_text, labels, messages, the typed line)
            into a buffer of this size plus the NUL. Longer texts are cut. The panel
            shows at most 32 characters (16x2) anyway.

endmenu
